# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# Redirect old WordPress URL patterns to new Astro structure

# WordPress date-based URLs to new blog URLs
# Format: /YYYY/MM/DD/post-slug -> /blog/post-slug
# Note: You may need to add specific redirects or use Cloudflare Bulk Redirects
# for complex patterns

# Common WordPress patterns
/feed /rss.xml 301
/feed/ /rss.xml 301
/rss /rss.xml 301
/rss/ /rss.xml 301

# Archive redirects (if your WordPress used /YYYY/MM/ format)
# Add specific redirects as needed, e.g.:
# /2024/01/my-post-slug /blog/my-post-slug 301

# Category and tag pages (if needed)
# /category/* /blog/ 301
# /tag/* /blog/ 301
